<title>JAPAN: Japan's Paris Miki applies to list on Tokyo bourse.</title>
<headline>Japan's Paris Miki applies to list on Tokyo bourse.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris Miki Inc has applied to the Finance Ministry for permission to list on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE), the exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said Paris Miki was likely to be listed on December 17, and planned to sell new 550,000 shares and 750,000 already-issued shares on the market.</p>
<p>Paris Miki sells spectacles, contact lenses, and related items.</p>
